@startuml
!include style.iuml
top to bottom direction
class Library {
  id : Identifier
  revision : Integer
  authorityInstanceId : Identifier
}
class Subject {
  id : Identifier
  identityStatus : String
}
class Source {
  id : Identifier
  ownerRecordId : Identifier
  currentVersion : Integer
}
class SourceVersion {
  version : Integer
  body : String
  capturedAt : Timestamp
}
class Event {
  id : Identifier
  currentVersion : Integer
}
class EventVersion {
  occurredAt : Timestamp
  timePrecision : String
  observationType : String
  context : StructuredData
}
class EventSource
class ResourceVersion {
  schemaRef : String
  payload : StructuredData
}
class Evidence {
  dimension : String
  sourceSpan : StructuredData
  status : String
}
Library "1" o-- "0..*" Subject
Library "1" o-- "0..*" Source
Source "1" *-- "1..*" SourceVersion
Event "1" *-- "1..*" EventVersion
Subject "1" -- "0..*" EventVersion : 经历者
Subject "0..1" -- "0..*" SourceVersion : 记录者
EventVersion "1" -- "1..*" EventSource
SourceVersion "1" -- "0..*" EventSource
EventVersion "0..*" -- "0..*" ResourceVersion : 精确使用版本
EventSource "1" -- "0..*" Evidence : 来源位置
note bottom of Event
同一真实经历使用同一稳定 Event.id。
事件合并保存别名与来源关系，独立计数使用归并后的标识。
全部实体限定在 Library 内。
end note
@enduml
